.TH GENBANK 4 2000-1月 "enumerateFeatures" "enumerateFeatures"
.SH NAME
enumerateFeatures \- enumerate all features in the given NCBI genbank database object
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIenumerateFeatures(\fBgb\fR as <generic> File, 
\fBkeys\fR as string = \fB<NULL>\fR);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
enumerate all features in the given NCBI genbank database object
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgb\fB \fR\- a NCBI genbank database object. 
.PP
.PP
\fBkeys\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the feature key name for filter the target 
 features. If this parameter is not specified, then all of the features 
 inside the given genbank object will be returned.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the [Feature](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.GBFF.Keywords.FEATURES.Feature) genbank feature object.
.PP
